5. Accessibility Compliance
- **Semantic HTML5**: Proper `<footer>`, `<h4>` hierarchy

•	Keyboard Navigation: Tab order follows visual flow
•	Screen Readers: Clear pronunciation of email, headings
•	Color Contrast: Inherits body text (passes WCAG 2.1 AA)
Conclusion
The footer implementation achieves professional standards through semantic structure, responsive Flexbox layout, and user-centered contact presentation. The "Stay Connected" section provides instant email accessibility while maintaining institutional branding. Cross-device testing confirms optimal performance across all screen sizes.
